OL,3,AAshes of exiled Nobel Laureate Miguel
OL,4,AAngel Asturias returned to Guatemala
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe remains of writer and diplomat
OL,7,FMiguel Angel Asturias have been buried
OL,8,Fin his native Guatemala 52 years after
OL,9,Fhe died in exile.
OL,11,FHis ashes were brought to Guatemala
OL,12,Ffrom Paris, where he had lived before
OL,13,Fhis death from cancer in the Spanish
OL,14,Fcapital, Madrid, in 1974.
OL,16,FAsturias was awarded the Nobel Prize
OL,17,Ffor Literature in 1967 for his vivid
OL,18,Fwritings, which drew on the experiences
OL,19,Fof indigenous Guatemalans.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
