OL,3,AAshes of exiled Nobel Laureate Miguel
OL,4,AAngel Asturias returned to Guatemala
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe urn containing his ashes was placed
OL,7,Fin soil gathered from different parts
OL,8,Fof Guatemala at a cultural centre named
OL,9,Fafter him in Guatemala City.
